This module (terminal-view) is vendored from Termux:
  https://github.com/termux/termux-app/tree/8629e632fcb95da272221be327db653fb24befe9/terminal-view
which is released under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).
It is derived from "Terminal Emulator for Android" by Jack Palevich
(https://github.com/jackpal/Android-Terminal-Emulator), also Apache-2.0.

Modifications for PocketShell (pkshell):
  - TerminalView / TerminalViewClient / TextSelectionCursorController use RemoteTerminalSession.
  - TerminalView.onCreateInputConnection: input type changed from TYPE_NULL to a composing text
    type so Korean (Hangul) IMEs such as Gboard can compose; composed text is sent as UTF-8 only
    when committed (commitText / finishComposingText). The commit-text-to-code-point logic was
    extracted to ImeTextDecoder.java so it is unit-testable on the JVM.
  - Gradle build script rewritten (Kotlin DSL, no maven-publish).
